# Purpose
Introduces GV-Manuals-Help as the public help and reference repo for GreatVibe
users and node-local agents.

# Key Sections
- What belongs here.
- What does not belong here.
- Repository map.
- Using these manuals.
- Publishing rules.

# Dependencies
- `SANITIZATION.md` for publication review.
- `CATALOGUE.md` for topic-level navigation.

# Gotchas
- Keep this page public-safe; avoid internal architecture promises or private
  operational details.
- Update the repository map whenever a new top-level help section, public guide,
  video metadata file, or transcript file is added.
- Do not list ACE companion files in the user-facing repository map.

